}"}, {"function_name": "UART_DMATransmitCplt", "function_type": "IRQ", "functionality": "DMA UART transmit process complete callback that handles DMA transmission completion, manages interrupt states, and triggers appropriate completion callbacks", "classification_reason": "This function is called from DMA interrupt handler (HAL_DMA_IRQHandler) and performs interrupt-related operations including enabling UART Transmit Complete Interrupt (USART_CR1_TCIE) and disabling DMA transfer request (USART_CR3_DMAT). It manages hardware interrupt states and serves as a callback for DMA completion events.", "has_replacement": true, "function_replacement": "static void UART_DMATransmitCplt(DMA_HandleTypeDef *hdma)
